{
  "uid": "data-refresh-tables",
  "title": "Observability Home - Support & Engineering",
  "description": "Entry dashboard for support and engineering. Use this page to start triage, then drill into the role-specific dashboards linked below.",
  "tags": [
    "home",
    "support",
    "engineering",
    "triage"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Support - Broker Overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/messaging-broker-multi-consumer",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Support - Delivery Diagnosis",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/consumer-delivery-diagnosis",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Support - Broker Resources",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/broker-bottleneck",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Support - Refresh Overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/data-refresh-overview",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Engineering - JVM & Process Detail",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/broker-system-metrics",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Engineering - Thread Deep Dive",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/thread-monitoring",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Engineering - ACK Reconciliation",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ack-reconciliation",
      "keepTime": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Active Consumer Groups",
      "type": "stat",
      "pluginVersion": "9.5.3",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
          },
          "expr": "count(count by(group, topic) (broker_consumer_lag))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Ingress Rate (msgs/s)",
      "type": "stat",
      "pluginVersion": "9.5.3",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(broker_messages_received_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Egress Rate (msgs/s)",
      "type": "stat",
      "pluginVersion": "9.5.3",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(broker_messages_sent_total[1m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Broker Container CPU Usage (%)",
      "type": "stat",
      "pluginVersion": "9.5.3",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-datasource"
          },
          "expr": "broker_container_cpu_usage_percent",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 20
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 40
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Support Triage Flow",
      "type": "text",
      "pluginVersion": "9.5.3",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Support path\n1. Start with [Support - Broker Overview](/d/messaging-broker-multi-consumer).\n2. If a consumer is unhealthy, open [Support - Delivery Diagnosis](/d/consumer-delivery-diagnosis).\n3. If CPU, memory, GC, or file pressure is suspected, open [Support - Broker Resources](/d/broker-bottleneck).\n4. If lag is growing, open [Support - Producer vs Consumer Gap](/d/producer-consumer-gap).\n5. If replay/refresh is involved, open [Support - Refresh Overview](/d/data-refresh-overview).\n\nUse support dashboards first. Escalate to engineering dashboards only after you know whether the issue is delivery, resource, refresh, storage, or replication."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Engineering Drilldown Map",
      "type": "text",
      "pluginVersion": "9.5.3",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Engineering path\n- Delivery internals: [Engineering - Per-Consumer Deep Dive](/d/per-consumer-metrics)\n- ACK drift or replay issues: [Engineering - ACK Reconciliation](/d/ack-reconciliation)\n- JVM/process detail: [Engineering - JVM & Process Detail](/d/broker-system-metrics)\n- Thread hot spots: [Engineering - Thread Deep Dive](/d/thread-monitoring)\n- Topic skew or hot partition patterns: [Engineering - Topic Performance](/d/topic-performance)\n- Parent broker ingestion issues: [Engineering - Pipe / Replication](/d/pipe-performance)\n- Refresh timing and replay details: [Engineering - Refresh Topic Detail](/d/data-refresh-monitoring) and [Engineering - Refresh Reliability](/d/refresh-reliability)\n- Storage deep dive: [Engineering - Storage Detail](/d/storage-health-detail)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Topics Replaying",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(data_refresh_state_code == 3) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Max Replay Gap Offset",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(data_refresh_replay_gap_offset) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
